  "source": "[n_ \\.natural.*./ m_]\nDefines: n_ * m_ is \\binary.operation:on{\\naturals}\nexpresses:\n. piecewise:\n  if: n_ = 0\n  then: n_ * m_ := 0\n  else:\n  . let: k is \\natural\n    where: n_ = \\naturals..S(k)\n    then: n_ * m_ := (k \\.natural.*./ m_) \\.natural.+./ m_\nDocumented:\n. called: \"$n_?$ times $m_?$\"\n. written: \"n_? \\cdot m_?\"\n. description: \"Multiplication of natural numbers defined by recursion:\n                $0 \\cdot m = 0$ and $S(k) \\cdot m = (k \\cdot m) + m$.\"\nId: \"46c21a80-12cd-45f6-8e74-07731d18d220\"",
